.TH TELACHAT-TK 1 "2026-05-25" "Telachat 0.41.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
telachat-tk \- start the Tk desktop frontend for Telachat
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B telachat-tk
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B telachat-tk
starts the native Tk/ttk desktop frontend. It uses the same configuration,
SQLite history, provider profiles, folders, tags, soft archives, prompt
templates, and slash commands as the
.B telachat
CLI.
Saved chats restore their provider and model selectors when loaded.
The Check action queries live \fB/models\fR for the selected provider and
merges returned model IDs into the selector without losing the current choice.
The System pane exposes a Theme selector. The persistent value is stored in
\fIconfig.toml\fR as \fBtheme\fR and can be temporarily overridden with
\fBTELACHAT_THEME\fR. If the persistent value is \fBsystem\fR,
\fBTELACHAT_SYSTEM_THEME\fR can force the detected palette for one process.
The composer also accepts \fB/theme NAME\fR.
Use \fB/find TEXT\fR to search within the currently loaded conversation.
.PP
The prompt supports Slash-Command suggestions while typing. Press Tab to
complete the current command and Shift+Enter to send a message.
Use \fB/edit-last TEXT\fR to replace the latest user message and remove the
following answer before regenerating.
Use \fB/fork [TITLE]\fR to copy the current conversation into a new independent
chat variant.
Use \fB/tag TAG\fR, \fB/untag TAG\fR, and \fB/tags\fR to manage flexible
chat labels.
Use \fB/stats\fR to show local history counters without chat content.
Use \fB/context\fR to estimate the loaded chat's next-request context size
without message content.
Use \fB/doctor\fR to run the same model-reachability check as the Check button.
Use \fB/exit\fR, \fB/quit\fR, or \fB/q\fR to close the window.
Use \fB/archive\fR, \fB/unarchive\fR, and \fB/archives\fR to hide completed
chats from normal lists and inspect the archive.
The sidebar archive filter switches the chat list between active, archived,
and all chats.
The sidebar tag filter narrows the chat list by saved tag and shows current tag
counts.
The System pane also exposes per-request temperature and max-token controls.
Successful replies report elapsed response time in the status area.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/telachat/config.toml
Default configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/telachat/history.sqlite3
SQLite chat history.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR telachat (1),
.BR telachat-gtk (1)
